---
title: "liquidate_adl_borrow_and_deposit (Current Finance - ADL Liquidation)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_pre_check: pre_liquidation_check(app, cap, market, adl_permission)
    q_pre_check --> q_validate: app.validate_market + ensure_version_matches
    q_validate --> q_check_adl_perm: ensure_has_permission(cap_id, adl_permission)
    q_check_adl_perm --> q_error_perm: ADL permission denied
    q_check_adl_perm --> q_check_circuit: assert(!market.has_circuit_break_triggered())
    q_check_circuit --> q_error_circuit: circuit break triggered
    q_check_circuit --> q_timestamp: now = clock.timestamp_ms() / 1000
    q_timestamp --> q_dispatch: ADLBorrow or ADLCollateral?
    q_dispatch --> q_adl_borrow: handle_debt_auto_deleverage (ADLBorrow)
    q_dispatch --> q_adl_collateral: handle_collateral_auto_deleverage (ADLCollateral)
    q_adl_borrow --> q_post_liq: post_liquidation(LiquidationType::ADLBorrow)
    q_adl_collateral --> q_post_liq: post_liquidation(LiquidationType::ADLCollateral)
    q_post_liq --> q_update_miners: update borrow + deposit reward managers
    q_update_miners --> q_emit: emit LiquidateEvent
    q_emit --> q_transfer: transfer collateral and refund to caller
    q_transfer --> [*]: return

    note right of q_pre_check
        INV-001: ADL requires distinct adl_permission (separate from normal liquidation permission)
        INV-002: ADL used for bad debt scenarios where normal liquidation is insufficient
    end note

    note right of q_dispatch
        INV-003: ADLBorrow reduces obligation debt without seizing proportional collateral
        INV-004: ADLCollateral seizes collateral to cover bad debt
        INV-005: Both ADL paths share same post-liquidation event emission and reward update logic
    end note
